 org being the discussion list and the yocto [dash] security [at] yoctoproj=
ect[dot] org being the security announcement list.

If the yocto [dash] security [at] yoctoproject[dot] org is in fact no longe=
r active I think it is important that the wiki page is changed to reflect t=
hat to prevent potential dangerous misunderstandings in the future.

Kind regards
Bent Bisballe Nyeng

